    "property_title": " The Pinnacle Iloilo Studio Unit ",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "The Pinnacle is a 1-tower, 20-storey building that is set to rise in the 72-hectare township of Iloilo Business Park. Inspired by a Brise Soleil, this residential development is designed to make each space warm and welcoming.\r\n\r\nIloilo Business Park in Madurriao Iloilo City is envisioned to be the next central business district in Iloilo City. It is home to Iloilo Contemporary Museum (ILOMOCA), Iloilo Convention Center and 1.1km Festive Walk.\r\n\r\nAmenities\r\n\r\nOutdoor\r\nLap Pool\r\nKiddie Pool\r\nOutdoor Lounge\r\nChildren’s Play Area\r\nOutdoor Fitness Area\r\nAtrium Garden\r\nJogging Path\r\nAlfresco\r\n\r\nIndoor\r\nMale and Female Changing & Shower Rooms\r\nDaycare\r\nFitness Gym\r\nFunction Room with Spill over\r\nPrivate Dining Room\r\n\r\nUnit Types:\r\nstudio = 24 sqm + 6 sqm lanai\r\n(insert current price, request from developer)",
